    {
      "source": "Simple <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/dao/support/PersistenceExceptionTranslator.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.dao.support\"><code>PersistenceExceptionTranslator</code></a> for Elasticsearch. Convert the given runtime exception to an\nappropriate exception from the <code>org.springframework.dao</code> hierarchy. Return null if no translation is\nappropriate: any other exception may have resulted from user code, and should not be translated.",
      "translation": "为 Elasticsearch 提供简单的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/dao/support/PersistenceExceptionTranslator.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.dao.support\"><code>PersistenceExceptionTranslator</code></a>。将给定的运行时异常转换为<code>org.springframework.dao</code>层次结构中的适当异常。如果不存在适当的转换，则返回 null：任何其他异常可能由用户代码引起，不应进行转换。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "translates an Exception if possible. Exceptions that are no <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/RuntimeException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>RuntimeException</code></a>s are wrapped in a\nRuntimeException",
      "translation": "如果可能，则转换异常。对于不是<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/RuntimeException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>RuntimeException</code></a>的异常，会将其包装在 RuntimeException 中。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
